helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151242				0	eo	\<link href=\"text/smath/02/03010000.xhp\" name=\"Formula Cursor\"\>Formula kursoro\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
