helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152553				0	eo	\<emph\>tabelo\</emph\> en la dua loko reprezentas la duan tabelon kun la sama nombro da vicoj.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152606				0	eo	\<item type=\"input\"\>5,06\</item\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
