helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156033				0	eo	3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156143				0	eo	Vi nun vidas unitan tabelon en ĉelaro A1:E5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156201				0	eo	10				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3156271				0	eo	MUNIT(Dimensio)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3157849				0	eo	\<emph\>tabelo\</emph\> reprezentas kvadratan tabelon invertotan.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3157922				0	eo	A				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3157945				0	eo	B				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3158084				0	eo	Tuj kiam vi alklakas al \<emph\>Akcepti\</emph\>, $[officename] Calc plenigas la supran ekzemplon per la LINSTIM-valoroj montritaj en la ekzemplo.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3158106				0	eo	La formulo en la breto \<emph\>Formulo\</emph\> korespondas al ĉiu ĉelo de la LINSTIM-tabelo \<item type=\"input\"\>{=LINSTIM(C2:C8;A2:B8;1;1)}\</item\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3158128				0	eo	\<emph\>Tio reprezentas la kalkulitajn LINSTIM-valorojn:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
