helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149215				0	eo	Nomo				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149494				0	eo	Kondiĉo				2002-02-02 02:02:02
